# Simulation scaffolding served from the dev server. Never part of the app.
#
# ASK THE SHAPE, NOT THE NAME. This read `sim*/` and only caught the folders
# somebody had already thought of. A run served from `public/run/` walked
# straight past it and reached a commit. A simulation always lands in a
# DIRECTORY here, and the app's own two files sit at the top level, so the
# directory is the property to match.
apps/web/public/*/
